The FHIR patient database is not redistributed in git. `make fetch` / `make load`
pull the published image jyxsu6/medagentbench (HAPI FHIR JPA Server Starter,
Apache-2.0, https://github.com/hapifhir/hapi-fhir-jpaserver-starter) and copy
its /data/test_db.mv.db into a local Docker bind mount. That database is the
MedAgentBench patient extract shipped by the benchmark authors.

The mock agent reimplements the benchmark's deterministic clinical steps
(search, then POST/PUT). It does not copy MedAgentBench refsol.py.
